
### ============================================
### VARIABLES
### ============================================
### Change @baseUrl to match your environment:
### - Local development: http://localhost:3001
### - Docker development: http://localhost:3001
### - Production: https://api.yourdomain.com
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@graphId=d72f320c-24c3-4a81-8b45-005f0b8e2fce


### ============================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECKS
### ============================================

### Root endpoint - API Welcome
GET {{baseUrl}}/

###

### ============================================
### 2. GRAPH UPLOAD - SUCCESS CASES
### ============================================

### Upload a valid graph with multiple edges
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "to": "B", "cost": 10 },
    { "from": "A", "to": "C", "cost": 5 },
    { "from": "B", "to": "D", "cost": 8 },
    { "from": "C", "to": "D", "cost": 12 },
    { "from": "D", "to": "E", "cost": 12 },
    { "from": "D", "to": "F", "cost": 4 },
    { "from": "F", "to": "G", "cost": 4 },
    { "from": "E", "to": "G", "cost": 9 },
    { "from": "C", "to": "H", "cost": 8 },
    { "from": "D", "to": "H", "cost": 4 },
    { "from": "F", "to": "H", "cost": 1 }
  ]
}

###

### Upload a simple graph with single edge
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "X", "to": "Y", "cost": 25 }
  ]
}

###

### ============================================
### 3. READ GRAPH - GET NODES
### ============================================

### Get graph by ID (success case)
### Note: Replace {graphId} with actual UUID from upload response
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/nodes/b61765b3-c26c-4950-97b0-6c4ed96ef669


###

### Get graph with invalid ID (not found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/nodes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

### Get graph with empty ID (bad request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/nodes/

###

### ============================================
### 4. ERROR HANDLING - VALIDATION TESTS
### ============================================

### Error: Invalid graph - missing 'from' field
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "to": "B", "cost": 10 }
  ]
}

###

### Error: Invalid graph - missing 'to' field
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "cost": 10 }
  ]
}

###

### Error: Invalid graph - missing 'cost' field
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "to": "B" }
  ]
}

###

### Error: Invalid graph - negative cost
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "to": "B", "cost": -5 }
  ]
}

###

### Error: Invalid graph - zero cost
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "to": "B", "cost": 0 }
  ]
}

###

### Error: Invalid graph - empty edges array
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": []
}

###

### Error: Invalid graph - empty node names
POST {{baseUrl}}/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "", "to": "B", "cost": 10 }
  ]
}

###

### ============================================
### 4. ROUTE OPTIMIZATION - DIJKSTRA'S ALGORITHM
### ============================================

### Calculate optimal route (success case)
### Returns: path array and total cost
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/{{graphId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originNodeId": "A",
  "destinationNodeId": "H"
}

###

### Error: Route optimization - missing destination
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/{{graphId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "A"
}

###

### Error: Route optimization - same origin and destination
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/{{graphId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "A",
  "destination": "A"
}

###

### Error: Route optimization - graph not found
POST {{baseUrl}}/route/optimize/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "A",
  "destination": "H"
}

###

### ============================================
### 5. PLANNED ENDPOINTS (Future Implementation)
### ============================================

### Get all graphs
GET {{baseUrl}}/network/graphs

###

### Delete graph by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/network/graphs/{graphId}

